{"term":{"label":"道","occurrences":11,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"5A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i","title":"萬章上","description":"萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"中","id":"中"},{"form":"予","id":"予"},{"form":"去","id":"去"},{"form":"堯","id":"堯"},{"form":"愛","id":"愛"},{"form":"斯","id":"斯"},{"form":"民","id":"民"},{"form":"湯","id":"湯"},{"form":"禹","id":"禹"},{"form":"聞","id":"聞"},{"form":"舜","id":"舜"},{"form":"虞","id":"虞"},{"form":"覺","id":"覺"},{"form":"言","id":"言"},{"form":"賢","id":"賢"},{"form":"道","id":"道"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.807507826196194,"source":"予","target":"民"},{"weight":3.4657359027997265,"source":"予","target":"覺"},{"weight":2.6548056865833978,"source":"予","target":"斯"},{"weight":1.6739764335716716,"source":"予","target":"道"},{"weight":2.5006550067561393,"source":"民","target":"斯"},{"weight":0.9602099658089904,"source":"民","target":"言"},{"weight":0.9136899501740977,"source":"民","target":"堯"},{"weight":0.24353228783885106,"source":"民","target":"舜"},{"weight":2.618438042412523,"source":"民","target":"覺"},{"weight":0.8266785731844679,"source":"民","target":"道"},{"weight":3.1938021873160847,"source":"斯","target":"言"},{"weight":3.060270794691562,"source":"斯","target":"覺"},{"weight":2.367123614131617,"source":"斯","target":"道"},{"weight":0.5082248420659334,"source":"湯","target":"堯"},{"weight":1.9898293829901488,"source":"湯","target":"聞"},{"weight":1.519825753744413,"source":"湯","target":"道"},{"weight":1.5833066333238488,"source":"堯","target":"舜"},{"weight":1.5378442592470916,"source":"堯","target":"聞"},{"weight":0.05623971832287611,"source":"堯","target":"禹"},{"weight":1.7609878105613013,"source":"堯","target":"道"},{"weight":0.8446970786871462,"source":"堯","target":"中"},{"weight":2.0794415416798357,"source":"虞","target":"道"},{"weight":3.4657359027997265,